      "content": "Wait, sorry, did you just say a \"steady stream of gold flowing from the treasure chest\"? I'm a bit confused. I'm just trying to do some standard accounting for a manufacturing plant, so I'm not sure why you're using terms like \"treasure chest.\" Can we just stick to the math for the report?",
